silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_01_reader_onboarding_sections_01_what_the_encyclopedia_is_concrete_anchor_9#mittensbodymassreading silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensBodyMassReading is the body-mass quality reading of Mittens: 4.2 kg measurement. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'BodyMass(Mittens)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
